//
// THE FRAME. The game is x east, y up, z SOUTH (north is -z: 28_island.js).
// A compass azimuth A (clockwise from TRUE north) and altitude h become
//     [ cos h sin A',  sin h,  -cos h cos A' ]      A' = A - convergence
